This is a prooftree in display math mode2. \[
\require{bussproofs}
\begin{prooftree}
  \AxiomC{ $\Gamma, A \vdash B$ }
  \RightLabel{ $\to$I }
  \UnaryInfC{ $\Gamma \vdash A \to B$ }
  \AxiomC{ $\Gamma \vdash A$ }
  \RightLabel{ $\to$E }
  \BinaryInfC{ $\Gamma \vdash B$ }
\end{prooftree}
\]
2 This is another prooftree but in the margin. \[
\begin{prooftree}
  \AxiomC{ $P$ }
  \AxiomC{ $P \to Q$ }
  \BinaryInfC { $Q$ }
\end{prooftree}
\]




